# The reference of the standard library the repository runs on: its
# pages, every path they document, for links from packages to it, and
# every name, for searching.
#
# Each row says which runtime it belongs to, its version and a digest of
# its library, so a repository started on a newer runtime writes the
# reference again and leaves the old one to be cleared.

